  "description": "YITAMOTOR provides you with the best innovative, quality products & professional services at competitive prices. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\nCompatible with 2017-2025 Mazda CX-5\nOnly fit for carpet flooring,only for carpet flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are compatible with 2017-2025 Mazda CX-5, not for vehicles with vinyl floors. 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and rear, Please remove old floor mats before installing new ones\nBuilt For Durability: YITAMOTOR floor mats are made from TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extreme cold or hot environments; Product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The custom floor mats fit for Mazda CX-5 2017-2025 are uniquely designed channels and raised edges that can effectively trap debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet\nEasy To Clean: The waterproof floor mats simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals are needed for maintenance\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats for cars are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guards to your vehicle",
